{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_panda_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_panda_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "一落千丈",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_panda_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1719c85442d1733ba2a2f8998712a3feff13df2c36f8fd9a2ff0ba071988538b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "食铁兽"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "龙门某高级公寓内"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答录通讯机",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答录通讯机",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您有一条语音留言，是否选择接听？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "（按下播放键）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答录通讯机",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "笙笙哪，你去哪里了？我到处跑，问了好多人，都说没见到你啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答录通讯机",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "我也是被骗了啊，谁想得到小成那家伙不是个东西，卷了钱就跑啊。这片子亮叔也投了钱的，我也心痛啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答录通讯机",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "笙笙，亮叔不得不说你一句啦，怎么能把钱全投在那项目上面呢，再喜欢那个剧本也不成啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答录通讯机",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "哎呀，现在好了，电影没拍成，钱也打了水漂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答录通讯机",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "唉，先不说了，知道你难过。亮叔在近卫局有认识的人，他们一定会全力侦办此案，钱肯定能追回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答录通讯机",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "你也别太失落，有空了记得给我回个电话啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "（按下结束键）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "头疼死了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "惨咯，血本无归啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "明明就是这老油条介绍来的制片，好嘛，出事了就甩得干干净净。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "啊啊啊——气死老子咯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "接下来啷个办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "干脆回老家继承我老爸的糖葫芦摊摊算咯......唉，这样老妈又不乐意了，她老想着我把家传的拳法发扬出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "（抓头发）啷个办啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "（打开冰箱门）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "啤酒......喝完了，威士忌......就一点了，伏特加......早空了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "什么嘛，都没了......看来只能下楼去买了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "（关上冰箱门）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "当啷——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "啊好痛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "什么啊......嘶，是昨天丢在地上的易拉罐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "（好多天都没出门了，屋里好乱......要不买完酒回来收拾下？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "（啧，算了，再说吧......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "嘿，精酿啤酒......来一打，朗姆酒啊，好久没喝了，也来一瓶！我再看看......最高一层还有精装伏特加。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "够不着......跳起来试试？嘿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "啊，不好，要掉下来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "噔噔咚，锵锵锵，这可难不倒我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "这也太、太厉害了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "呃，你是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "笙笙小姐，您是笙笙小姐，居然真的是您！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "我、我是您的粉丝，您的每一部电影我都有看，您的《天涯侠女》三部曲，每一部我都看了很多遍，能见到您，我、我简直太、太......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "那个，我不是笙笙小姐，你认错人了，认错人了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "怎么会呢？您刚刚接瓶子的姿势，和《百万龙门币》里的姿势一模一样啊！这片我看了七遍，不会看错的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "是吗？哈哈，这片子拍完可有好久了......有五六年了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "笙笙小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "......哎呀，总之就是你认错了，我得去结账了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "笙笙小姐，我是不是打扰到您了，对不起，我、我不是故意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "真的不好意思！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "哎，你，我、我不是这个意思，我就是......唉，所以你是想要签名吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "签名？！可以吗？真是太谢谢您了，我找张纸，您等下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "这，你能找到吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "（这家伙快把全身的口袋翻遍了啊......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "找到了，我这有张......钞票......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "要不......这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "唉，笙笙小姐，就这张钞票了，拜托您帮我签个名吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "呃——好吧，没问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "（这钞票也太皱了吧！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "谢谢您，谢谢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "你很喜欢武侠吗？除了电影，看过小说吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "是啊，笙笙小姐，黄先生的大部头，齐四的小短篇，还有当时的《武侠月刊》，我本本都读，期期都看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "你喜欢齐四小姐？我身边很多人都说她写得太拖沓了，看着一点都不爽利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "那怎么是拖沓呢，齐四小姐文笔细腻，动情处让人潸然泪下，她的作品都是不可多得的佳作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "你说的真是太——对了，这群榆木脑袋真是一点都不会欣赏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "笙笙小姐，您也喜欢齐四小姐的书？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "我最最最喜欢《合意拳》了！家里的那一本都快要被翻烂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "这书本来是要改编拍成电影的，可是演小云生的人因为偷税进了近卫局，制片又卷了钱跑路，后来不了了之，再没了下文。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "唉，真是可惜，无缘得见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "世事无常，谁想得到呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "嗯......不对。小云生为人正直，侠肝义胆，宁愿粉身碎骨也不愿意与权贵同流合污，那样的演员怎么能演出他这一身风骨呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "黄了好，黄了才好，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "......也对，也对，哈哈，这么想倒也不错，哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "你这家伙，说得对。那人脾气又差，演技也不过关，宝气得很！和小云生一点也不搭，知道是他来演，我发了好大一通脾气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "是啊，幸好幸好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "啊，天快暗了，我得赶紧回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "我、我也得走了，笙笙小姐，有缘再见，呃不，应该也没什么机会了，谢谢您的签名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "哎，等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "张大姐，纳兰州黄沙滚滚，这一去不复返，何日能再归，何时能再见？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "云家小子，有家才能归，有缘方再会，世事难料，珍重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "嘿，你果然是真喜欢这个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "再见啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二天"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "啊......头好痛，宿醉好难受，昨天就不该喝那么多，呜......要死要死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "笙笙姐，你这是怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "梨花啊，今天有没有热的脱脂奶，可以帮我拿一杯吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "笙笙姐，我们今天歇业一天，这会儿我正打算关门回家呢，恐怕没法招呼你了，不好意思啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "歇业？发生什么了？我昨天来不还开得好好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "唉，昨天晚上店里面遭贼了。小偷在逃跑时打翻了好几个货架，搞得里面狼藉一片，刚刚我才打扫完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "啊，那小偷抓到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "呼——幸好抓到了，宝仔姐亲手抓到的。小偷奋力挣扎时她还受伤了，额角破了好大一块。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "啊，宝仔现在人呢？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "笙笙姐你别着急啊，宝仔姐在医院涂了点药就回去了，没事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "是了，宝仔她身手一直很不错，那个小贼遇到她才算是倒大霉了。哎，对了，最近有人找你们打听过我的消息吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "有几个鬼鬼祟祟的记者来过，问了笙笙姐你最近的去向。我按宝仔姐嘱咐的，随便扯几句搪塞着打发走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "（抓头）这几天麻烦你们了，改天一定请你们吃大餐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "嗨，当时多亏了笙笙姐你的帮助，我和宝仔姐才能在龙门扎根生活下去，我们为你做这些不算什么的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我不也老来蹭你们酒喝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "这能喝掉几个钱。噢，对了，笙笙姐，你身上的财物都齐全吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "都在......吧，怎么问起这个了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "那个小偷昨天和你说了好一会儿话，我想着......搞不好那人趁着你不注意会偷拿你的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "哼哼，怎么会有人不长眼偷我东西——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "等等，你刚刚说谁？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "啊，就是你昨天来买酒时，主动上前和你聊天的男人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "什么！他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "笙笙姐，怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "呃......那家伙现在在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "在、在近卫局的拘留所里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "我先走了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——改天见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "哎？笙笙姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "（低头）我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员A",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "小伙子，既然这位女士愿意替你出罚款，出去之后好好做人，这种小偷小摸的事就不要再犯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "阿sir教训的是，一定不会再犯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员A",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "你还是先好好谢谢这位女士吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "......麻烦您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "你这家伙，到底为什么要做这种事啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "（肚子咕噜作响）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "算了，先出去带你吃点东西吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "阿sir，麻烦你啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员A",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "这声音......好熟悉啊，感觉在哪里听过？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员B",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "你这家伙真是呆，那位就是万小姐啊，你昨天不刚看过人家的《近卫局往事》。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员A",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "嗯？！你说那位戴墨镜的女士是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员B",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "对，是你最喜欢的武打女星万笙笙小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员A",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "所以我到底错过了什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员B",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "啧，不过这位大明星最近可不好过啊，投资电影失败，恐怕要倾家荡产了哪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员A",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "怎么会这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员B",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "你都没看新闻吗？最近传得沸沸扬扬，好像是合作方财务出了问题，直接把烂摊子丢给万小姐，自己跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员A",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "不要啊，笙笙小姐一定很难过的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "二位的大份鳞丸好了，加了萝卜与粉面，请享用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "老板你真的是好手艺，我就是吃一万次也不会腻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "哈哈，你都是大明星了，还总来吃小摊，不怕被狗仔拍到笑你啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "有什么好怕的，被拍到就当给你做广告咯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "别别，我可付不起广告费。哎，靓仔，你怎么光看不吃啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "吃就是了，拘谨什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "谢谢笙笙小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "你们先聊，我去看看炉子上煮着的咖喱汤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "原来这就是鳞丸，来龙门后我还是第一次吃，真的好吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "这边我经常来的，据说老板是龙门大帮派的头目，后来金盆洗手摆摊来做鳞丸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "噗——咳咳咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "（看过来）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "嘻嘻，骗你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "咳咳......咕咚，没事没事，笙笙小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "对了，你还没有回答我呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "我、我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "为什么要去店里做那样的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "我......两天没吃饭，饿昏头了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "好哇，饿昏头偷东西也就算了，为什么还要伤人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "老板娘逮到我时，看到我手里攥着张钞票，想让我把钱付了，不然不放我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "然后你不想付账，所以打伤了老板娘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "......笙笙小姐，那张钞票，是我身上最后一张了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "那也不至于为了这个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "唉，你说的是那张啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "嗯，本来昨天进店是打算拿它买些吃的，但是遇到了你，你还在上面签了名，我实在是不想花出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "是这样啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "你现在......有地方去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "没、没有，上周刚刚被房东赶出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "接下来怎么办，想回老家吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "父母走得早，老家也没什么亲人在了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "这边还有朋友吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "才来龙门两个月，哪有什么认识的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "笙笙小姐，我没啥本事......讨生活，也不容易。能见到你，我真的很开心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "唉，别这么想，总会好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "（抹眼泪）笙笙小姐，我不好，给你添麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "那之后......你打算怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "不知道，只要有一口饭吃，日子总能往下过吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "老板，你有笔吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "哎，有，在小抽屉里，你自己拿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "我看看啊，找到了，再扯你一张纸行不？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "拿就是了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "（提笔写字）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "笙笙小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "喏，这是我认识的一位场务负责人，你去找他给你安排些打杂跑腿的活，他那儿挣得不多，好在包吃住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "谢谢你......笙笙小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "老板，再来两份鳞丸，一份打包带走，一份还在这里吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "好嘞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "以后的日子好好过，埋头向前走，过去的日子就甩得远远的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "鳞丸一份，打包好了，您拿好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "这一份你带去吧，不是白请你的，以后挣了钱，可要请回来啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "呜呜呜......笙笙小姐，真的不好意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "好了，快去片场吧，不然一会儿他们下班了你找不到人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "嗯，笙笙小姐，我走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "再见啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潦倒的男人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "笙笙小姐，我会努力做事，踏实做人的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "好好，我知道了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "叹什么气，怎么，我的鳞丸不够味啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "老板，我也好难啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "到底发生什么了，亮叔昨天来找过我，说你一周没接他的电话了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "你还记得我和你说过的那个本子吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "齐四的《合意拳》？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "嗯，赔了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "全部家当。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "不至于吧，就一分一毫也没剩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "是剩了些积蓄，不过那部分是固定打给慈善基金组织的钱，不能动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "那你之后打算怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "要是幸运的话，说不定能抓到人，把钱追回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "要是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "那就只能重头再来了。我还有一身好功夫，总有片子拍的，饿不着啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "那你本来计划好的那些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "哪有什么计划了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "人嘛，越不清醒越喜欢长虑后顾，要么在半夜里想明天，要么在醉话里说未来，睡醒来酒醒后就回过味了，想得少才能活得好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "总会碰上转机的，将来肯定会好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "不用安慰我啦，我很坚强的。只要明天还能吃到你的鳞丸，我的日子就能往下过！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "你怎么还竖上大拇指了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "嗨，再说，过日子哪能光靠转机呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "有时候遇上件小小的开心事，就短短那一会儿，哪怕什么也改变不了，我就能靠这点快活再把日子往下过几天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "那你最近遇上什么开心事了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "有啊，我刚刚吃了你的鳞丸啊，舌头都香掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "啧，还有别的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "嗯......我想想，对了，有个导演联系我了，片酬给得蛮高，我打算明天去试镜看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "好，那我也来请你吃一碗鳞丸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "（端上桌一碗鳞丸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "欸，新做法吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "想试试制作香辣口味的鳞丸，不知道有没有市场，正好拜托你来试试口味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "好吃耶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "啊啊啊舌头烧起来了，连我都觉得好辣啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "这边有冰水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万笙笙",
      "speakerId": "avg_241_panda_1",
      "text": "啊啊啊才不喝，嘶哈嘶哈，这可是好兆头，不可以浇凉水......嘶哈，我的事业一定会红红火火，再创辉煌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "avg_272_strong_1",
      "text": "你啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "两周后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员B",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "小贾，早啊，喏，给你带了杯咖啡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员A",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "谢谢尧哥，麻烦了。今天怎么样，忙吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员B",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "事情多得很哪！哎，你把报纸翻来翻去的找什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员A",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "我在找娱乐版。尧哥，说来也奇怪，最近看报都没看到笙笙小姐的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员B",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "你不知道吗？几天前笙笙小姐在片场受伤了，被送入急诊室了，也不知道伤情如何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员A",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "可要是皮外伤应该很快就出院了，怎么这么久还不见报道啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员B",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "明星嘛，出了事肯定低调，说不定这会儿已经回家了，你就别担心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员A",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "可是我还是心里很忐忑......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员B",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "怎么了，大老爷们儿这么敏感啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员A",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "不是，早上出门，我看见笙笙小姐的广告都被撤下了，一张都没剩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员B",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "啧，怪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
